1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,029
Gaz yo'q uylar uchun yangi imtiyoz!

2
00:00:02,250 --> 00:00:05,435
Vazirlar Mahkamasi qaroriga ko'ra, elektr energiyasining

3
00:00:05,435 --> 00:00:08,900
oylik bazaviy me'yori 200 kilovatt-soatdan 350

4
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,410
kilovatt-soatga oshirildi.

5
00:00:10,630 --> 00:00:12,952
Shu me'yor doirasida har bir kilovatt-soat

6
00:00:12,952 --> 00:00:14,949
uchun 650 so'm to'lanadi.

7
00:00:15,169 --> 00:00:17,637
Imtiyoz tabiiy gaz bilan ta'minlanmagan yoki

8
00:00:17,637 --> 00:00:20,762
gaz yetkazib berish cheklangan hududlardagi xonadonlarga

9
00:00:20,762 --> 00:00:21,309
tegishli.

10
00:00:21,530 --> 00:00:24,536
Yangi tartib 1-noyabrdan amal qiladi, shuning

11
00:00:24,536 --> 00:00:26,692
uchun noyabr oyi to'lovlari ham qayta

12
00:00:26,692 --> 00:00:27,429
hisoblanadi.

13
00:00:27,649 --> 00:00:30,562
Masalan, oyiga 300 kilovatt-soat ishlatgan xonadon

14
00:00:30,562 --> 00:00:33,104
eski me'yorda 220 ming so'm to'lar

15
00:00:33,104 --> 00:00:33,369
edi.

16
00:00:33,590 --> 00:00:35,889
Yangi me'yorda esa hisob-kitobga ko'ra, bu

17
00:00:35,889 --> 00:00:38,829
summa 195 ming so'mni tashkil qiladi.

18
00:00:39,049 --> 00:00:41,366
Eng muhimi, ariza yozish yoki idoralarga

19
00:00:41,366 --> 00:00:44,250
borish shart emas, imtiyoz avtomatik qo'llaniladi.

20
00:00:44,469 --> 00:00:46,325
Sizning hududingizda gaz bormi?

21
00:00:46,325 --> 00:00:47,890
Fikringizni izohda yozing.
